# React patterns

Function components and hooks only. No class components, no `defaultProps` on functions, no legacy lifecycles.

Module state: RTK slices + RTK Query via generated `createApiClient` (skill `rtk-query-api-client`). Extract a hook when logic is reused. Presentational components stay dumb.

Copy `modules/auth/ui` (widget + slice + hook), not a new architecture. Controls from `@namma-medmate/shared-ui` (skill `shadcn-shared-ui`).

```tsx
// BAD
class AuthWidget extends React.Component {
  render() { return <div />; }
}

// GOOD
import { Button } from '@namma-medmate/shared-ui';
export function AuthWidget() {
  const session = useAppSelector((s) => s.session);
  return <section><Button>{session.status}</Button></section>;
}
```
